      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُثْقَلٌ</span></b>  <i>Heavily burdened:</i> (TA:) or <i>burdened
beyond his power; overburdened.</i> (JK, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
(assumed tropical:)  <i>Weighed down,</i> or <i>oppressed,</i> by sickness, or
disease, (JK,) and by debt. (JK, Er-Rághib.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَقِيلٌ</span>.

